import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="How We Rate AI Forex Signals & Strategies | AITrader Forex" canonical="https://aitraderforex.com/how-we-rate/">
  <div class="container max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-primary prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-text prose-p:text-muted prose-a:text-primary prose-strong:text-text">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 not-prose">
      <span class="inline-block text-primary text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Methodology</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-text mb-4">Our Rigorous Testing Methodology</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">At AITrader Forex, trust is our most valuable asset. Our rankings are not for sale. Here is how we ensure 100% objective, data-driven reviews of AI signal providers and trading strategies.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. The AI Signal Score (1–10)</h2>
    <p>Every AI signal provider receives a composite score across five weighted pillars:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Performance (30%):</strong> Live verified track record — win rate, drawdown, monthly return, Sharpe ratio. Minimum 90-day observation period. No cherry-picked results.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparency (25%):</strong> Does the provider share Myfxbook or similar verified tracking? Are trades published in real-time or retroactively? We check for hidden stop-loss widening and trade manipulation.</li>
      <li><strong>AI Authenticity (20%):</strong> Is the service actually using AI/ML or just marketing hype? We verify algorithmic claims — looking for real machine learning signals vs. manual traders operating under an "AI" label.</li>
      <li><strong>Value & Pricing (15%):</strong> Monthly subscription vs. average monthly return. Hidden fees, setup costs, cancellation policies, refund guarantees.</li>
      <li><strong>User Experience (10%):</strong> Platform usability, alert delivery speed (Telegram/Discord/Email), customer support responsiveness, onboarding ease.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Strategy Review Methodology</h2>
    <p>For trading strategy reviews, we evaluate:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Methodology Soundness:</strong> Is the AI/ML approach theoretically valid? We check for overfitting, look-ahead bias, and data snooping.</li>
      <li><strong>Backtest Quality:</strong> Out-of-sample testing, walk-forward analysis, Monte Carlo simulation results.</li>
      <li><strong>Live Performance:</strong> Forward-tested results on demo and live accounts with trade-by-trade audit trails.</li>
      <li><strong>Risk Management:</strong> Position sizing, maximum drawdown controls, correlation to market regimes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Independent Acquisition</h2>
    <p>We purchase or subscribe to every signal service anonymously. We never use "reviewer accounts" that might receive preferential treatment, augmented statistics, or special profit-sharing arrangements.</p>

    <h2>4. Verification Standards</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Myfxbook Verified:</strong> We only count performance from Myfxbook or equivalent third-party tracking platforms</li>
      <li><strong>Minimum 90 Days:</strong> No signal provider is reviewed with less than 90 days of live trading history</li>
      <li><strong>Minimum 50 Trades:</strong> Statistical significance requires at least 50 closed trades</li>
      <li><strong>Real Money Only:</strong> Demo account results are flagged; only live funded accounts count toward performance scores</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Continuous Monitoring</h2>
    <p>Our reviews are never static. If a top-rated signal provider's performance degrades, changes their trading approach, or gets negative community sentiment, we immediately downgrade their score and alert our newsletter subscribers. We re-test every signal provider quarterly.</p>

    <h2>6. Editorial Independence</h2>
    <p><strong>We do not accept payment for higher scores.</strong> Our rankings are purely data-driven. To keep the site free, we may earn affiliate commissions if you sign up through our links — but this never impacts our scores or verdicts. Every page includes clear affiliate disclosure.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>